WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.530
Your AI knows you.

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.250
Your work, your interests, your plans.

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:06.990
Now use that knowledge on your terms.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.870
Ask the assistant you already use to put your context into a

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:12.210
profile.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.960
Bring its reply into Attention.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:17.190
There you are.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.630
Your goals, your interests, what you already know.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.870
Check it, change it.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.390
It's yours to use.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.890
Then protect your data with a password.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.080
Now, back to the web.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.980
A first signal before you open a link.

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:41.130
On the article, hover over the title for a closer look.

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:47.480
Jump to passages that may add something for you with the context

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.080
around them.

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:58.060
Choose what to read on your terms, not someone else's algorithms.

00:00:58.980 --> 00:00:59.760
Attention.
